# CROWNS OVER THE SHOULDER (world.gdshader and leaf.gdshader `crown_cut`): at eye
# level a crown is taken away only where it stands between the eye and a body
# (the sight cone), never in a ring round the player. The orchards' rows and the
# pinewood, each from above and then over the shoulder among the trees.
#   tools/tour.sh tours/crowns-eye.tour --seed=1 --hour=11 --weather=clear:0
place grey_orchards
near graft_tree
wait 1.5
shot 01-orchard-from-above with land:grey_orchards
tap shoulder
await shoulder 20
wait 1.2
shot 02-orchard-over-the-shoulder with shoulder
mouse 640,0 0.6
wait 1.0
shot 03-orchard-turned with shoulder
tap shoulder
wait 1.5
place pinewood
near pine
wait 1.5
shot 04-pinewood-from-above with land:pinewood
tap shoulder
await shoulder 20
wait 1.2
shot 05-pinewood-over-the-shoulder with shoulder
